  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n625 / 125 of 45 / 225 + 256 / 64 ÷ 56 / 196 \n\n**Formula used:**\n\n1. A of B = A × B\n\n2. Division of fractions: (A)/(B) ÷ (C)/(D) = (A)/(B) × (D)/(C) \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n625 / 125 = 5\n\n45 / 225 = 1 / 5\n\n5 × 1/5 = 1 \n\n256 / 64 = 4\n\n56 / 196 = 2 / 7 \n\n4 × 7/2 = 14\n\n⇒ 1 + 14 = 15\n\n**∴ The value of the expression is 15.**",
